WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.020
We need a new wall in this
room. Can you build it?

2
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:08.040
Hello, I'm Jules, the plasterboard fitter.

3
00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:11.560
I'll build a partition,
and I'll plaster it.

4
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.920
Will it be ready this week?

5
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:20.980
Yes. First I fix the frame. Then I put
up the boards, and I finish the joints.

6
00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.360
It will be smooth and white.
